    "content": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 1,
          "numbered": true,
          "id": "ch-intro"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Introduction"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2,
          "numbered": true
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Overview and Background"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Hot and arid regions such as Al-Majmaah place heavy demands on building cooling. This project designs a community centre that responds to the climate through orientation, shading and thermal mass "
          },
          {
            "type": "citation",
            "attrs": {
              "keys": [
                "givoni1998",
                "olgyay2015"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2,
          "numbered": true
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Problem Statement"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Cooling accounts for most of the electricity used by buildings in the region, and its peak drives the peak of the grid "
          },
          {
            "type": "citation",
            "attrs": {
              "keys": [
                "hong2016"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The project asks how far passive design can lower that peak."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2,
          "numbered": true
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Aims and Objectives"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The project aims to reduce the cooling load of the centre by a third against a conventional design while meeting the program and the standards reviewed in "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "attrs": {
              "target": "ch-standards"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
