        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The design follows the Saudi Building Code for energy conservation and the program distribution shown in "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "attrs": {
              "target": "fig-program"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "figure",
        "attrs": {
          "src": "figures/system-diagram.png",
          "widthPercent": 75,
          "id": "fig-program"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "caption",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Program distribution and adjacency diagram (prepared by the authors)"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 1,
          "numbered": true,
          "id": "ch-site"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Site Analysis and Conceptual Design"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The solar heat gain through a window of area "
          },
          {
            "type": "inlineMath",
            "attrs": {
              "latex": "A"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and solar heat gain coefficient "
          },
          {
            "type": "inlineMath",
            "attrs": {
              "latex": "g"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " under irradiance "
          },
          {
            "type": "inlineMath",
            "attrs": {
              "latex": "I"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is given by equation "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "attrs": {
              "target": "eq-gain"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "equation",
        "attrs": {
          "latex": "Q_{\\mathrm{solar}} = g \\, A \\, I",
          "numbered": true,
          "id": "eq-gain"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Shading the west facade reduces "
          },
          {
            "type": "inlineMath",
            "attrs": {
              "latex": "I"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " on the glazing by about 70% in the afternoon peak."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 1,
          "numbered": true,
          "id": "ch-conclusion"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Conclusion and Recommendations"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The concept combines a shaded courtyard, a double roof and deep west fins. Detailed simulation in Senior Design 2 will verify the expected reduction in the cooling load."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "appendixStart"
